# Workflow and policy files decide what CI is allowed to do, so a change to
# one is a change to the review gate itself. Naming an owner here does not
# require the review on its own -- branch protection's "require review from
# Code Owners" does -- but nothing can require it until the file exists.
/.github/           @andrew01234567890
/hack/check-actions.sh      @andrew01234567890
/hack/ci/                   @andrew01234567890
